  "id": "https://samsm.ch/edgeland-nottingham/",
  "type": "Article",
  "name": "Edgeland Nottingham",
  "summary": "\u003cp\u003eI was recently looking through all the photos I took during my 4 years living in\nNottingham to see if I could come up with some kind of series out of them. After\ncutting it down to all the black \u0026amp; white images that turned out reasonably I had\njust over 200 photos so I needed to come up with some more specific ideas. One\ntheme I tend to shoot a lot is where nature meets the built environment, which\nlead me to put together this series. I got the title, and some inspiration, from\n\u003ca href=\"https://www.robinfriend.co.uk/bastard-countryside\"\u003eRobin Friend\u0026rsquo;s Bastard\nCountryside\u003c/a\u003e (watch \u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EkS_jxaej90\"\u003ethis\nvideo\u003c/a\u003e for a good introduction).\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/13707/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/13707/13707.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 01\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo looking through a hedgerow across the roofs of some brick houses with farmland heading into the horizon\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"13707\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e",
  "content": "\u003cp\u003eI was recently looking through all the photos I took during my 4 years living in\nNottingham to see if I could come up with some kind of series out of them. After\ncutting it down to all the black \u0026amp; white images that turned out reasonably I had\njust over 200 photos so I needed to come up with some more specific ideas. One\ntheme I tend to shoot a lot is where nature meets the built environment, which\nlead me to put together this series. I got the title, and some inspiration, from\n\u003ca href=\"https://www.robinfriend.co.uk/bastard-countryside\"\u003eRobin Friend\u0026rsquo;s Bastard\nCountryside\u003c/a\u003e (watch \u003ca href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EkS_jxaej90\"\u003ethis\nvideo\u003c/a\u003e for a good introduction).\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/13707/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/13707/13707.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 01\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo looking through a hedgerow across the roofs of some brick houses with farmland heading into the horizon\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"13707\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/12010/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/12010/12010.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 02\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a brick house behind a small grassy area with a few small bare trees\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"12010\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"diptych\"\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/12812/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/12812/12812.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 03\"\n         alt=\"Black and white photo of the base of a tree, the trunk of which is wrapped in a wire mesh\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"12812\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/12810/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/12810/12810.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 04\"\n         alt=\"Black and white photo of the base of a tree surrouned by a square of old wood and metal fencing in a large and mostly empty field\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"12810\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/6602/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/6602/6602.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 05\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"6602\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/12805/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/12805/12805.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 06\"\n         alt=\"Black and white photo of a line of sticks stuck in a pond, linked with two pieces of wire to create a fence which creates an \u0026#34;S\u0026#34; shape\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"12805\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/12806/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/12806/12806.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 07\"\n         alt=\"Black and white photo of a stream emerging from a concrete pipe, surrounded by a forest of bare trees\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"12806\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"diptych\"\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/12709/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/12709/12709.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 08\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a pond surrounded by reeds with a line of trees in the background and various pieces of litter in the foreground\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"12709\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/13201/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/13201/13201.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 09\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a ford through a stream surrounded by a lot of vegetation including bare trees\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"13201\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/13210/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/13210/13210.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 10\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a power plant with 8 cooling towers and one tall chimney behind a tree line, which is on the edge of a wide river which curves from the bottom centre of the image to the left\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"13210\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/13206/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/13206/13206.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 11\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a path atom a berm with a staircase heading down surrounded by metal fencing in the foreground, and trees and electricity transmission wires and a pylon in the background\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"13206\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/11810/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/11810/11810.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 12\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo looking down at a narrow road in between dense vegetation and the base of a large electricity pylon in the top right corner of the image\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"999\"\n\t\t id=\"11810\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/6410/\" name=\"13\" \u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/6410/6410.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 13\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"6410\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/7101/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/7101/7101.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 14\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"7101\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/6910/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/6910/6910.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 15\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"6910\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"diptych\"\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/12707/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/12707/12707.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 16\"\n         alt=\"Black \u0026amp; white photo of a corner of a small bricked wall below a bridge with patches of white paint where graffiti has been painted over and one piece of uncovered graffiti\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"12707\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/7008/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/7008/7008.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 17\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"7008\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"diptych\"\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/6310/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/6310/6310.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 18\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"6310\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/7106/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/7106/7106.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 19\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"7106\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/7105/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/7105/7105.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 20\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"7105\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/7102/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/7102/7102.avif\"\n         title=\"Clifton Bridge\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"7102\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/7012/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/7012/7012.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 22\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"7012\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/6311/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/6311/6311.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 23\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"6311\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/6306/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/6306/6306.avif\"\n         title=\"Edgeland Nottingham 24\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"6306\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThis series was shot with my Hasselblad 500C/M, CF 60mm and 150mm lenses, and\nIlford HP5+ at EI 800 and developed in HC-110 1+49 for 11 minutes, except for\n\u003ca href=\"/edgeland-nottingham/#13\"\u003eimage 13\u003c/a\u003e, which was shot on Ilford FP4+ at EI 400 and developed in HC-110\n1+49 for 16 minutes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn Feburary 2019 I started shooting a series with a similar theme in a small\nnature reserve in Nottingham on Fuji Pro 400H, but I\u0026rsquo;ve never been able to get\nacceptable scans from the 2 rolls I shot. If I do manage to get something useful\nfrom them I might put together a part 2 to this project.\u003c/p\u003e",
